  "progression": {
    "yearOne": "Modern Hebrew 1 through 4 are sequential. Biblical Hebrew requires Modern Hebrew 3 plus simultaneous Modern Hebrew 4. Despite the block-six catalogue allocation, its own dated entry specifies first lectures in block five alongside Modern Hebrew 4.",
    "yearTwo": "The two 3000 jaar Hebreeuws units build on Modern Hebrew 4 and then on each other. Ulpan follows the second or equivalent knowledge. The first three replacement modules are in block 4 and the remaining two in block 5. The rabbinic-text record expects Modern Hebrew 1–4 and recommends Biblical Hebrew. The other module records do not impose an unmet entrance condition.",
    "yearThree": "Bible (+ source texts) requires Biblical Hebrew or equivalent, supplied in year one. The 12 EC thesis follows the subject-specific units. Preserve 30 EC genuine choice, subject to level, approval and non-overlap rules.",
    "zeroCredits": "The catalogue lists the diagnostic Dutch writing assessment and recurring tutoring at 0 EC."
